{"parse":{"title":"Make Pancakes","pageid":33060,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"featurestar\">\n<div class=\"mwimg  t floatright \" style=\"max-width:14px\"><div class=\"noresize\"><map name=\"ImageMap_1_881751821\"><area href=\"/Category:Featured-Articles\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"0,0,14,14\" alt=\"This is a featured article. Click here for more information.\" title=\"This is a featured article. Click here for more information.\" /></map><img alt=\"LinkFA star.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f4/LinkFA-star.jpg/14px-LinkFA-star.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" class=\"whcdn\" usemap=\"#ImageMap_1_881751821\" /></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div><p>Pancakes are a traditional breakfast treat that are easy to make. Once you get the basic recipe down, you can start experimenting and putting your own spin on these breakfast-time favorites.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ingredients\">Ingredients</span></h2>\n<p>The following ingredients will make about 8-10 inch (20-25 cm) pancakes (more or fewer, depending on the size); you may change the amounts of ingredients according to the number you wish to serve:\n</p>\n<ul><li>2 cups (18oz/510g) self-rising or all-purpose <a href=\"/Make-Flour\" title=\"Make Flour\">flour</a> (See tips below)</li>\n<li>2 or 3 eggs</li>\n<li>1 1/2 cups (350ml) of milk</li>\n<li>1/2 teaspoon of baking soda</li>\n<li>2 tablespoons of butter or vegetable oil</li>\n<li>5 tablespoons of sugar</li>\n<li>1/2 teaspoon of vanilla extract (optional)</li>\n<li>A pinch of salt.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recipe-for-Pancakes\">Recipe for Pancakes</span></h3>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/Break-an-Egg\" title=\"Break an Egg\">Crack the eggs</a> into a bowl and beat until creamy. Add in the dry ingredients (excluding the salt and baking soda if using self-rising flour). <i>Do not</i> stir the mixture at this point!<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-1-Version-3.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 1 Version 3.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7c/Make-Pancakes-Step-1-Version-3.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-1-Version-3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Melt-Butter\" title=\"Melt Butter\">Melt</a> the butter in a microwave-safe bowl. Make sure that it's completely melted; about a minute is sufficient.<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-2-Version-3.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 2 Version 3.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a1/Make-Pancakes-Step-2-Version-3.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-2-Version-3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Add the butter and milk to the mix. Stir gently, leaving some small clumps of dry ingredients in the batter. Do not blend until completely smooth. If your batter is smooth, your pancakes will be tough and flat as opposed to fluffy.<sup id=\"_ref-1\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 1\"><a href=\"#_note-1\">[1]</a></sup><br /><br /><video playsinline=\"\" webkit-playsinline=\"\" id=\"mvid-f932af4d54\" data-poster=\"/images/thumb/3/3b/Make-Pancakes-Step-3-Version-3.jpg/550px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-3-Version-3.jpg\" data-src=\"/c/c8/Make Pancakes Step 3 Version 3.360p.mp4\" controlslist=\"nodownload\" data-watermark=\"1\" data-controls=\"1\" data-vidfile=\"Make Pancakes Step 3 Version 3.360p.mp4\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"wh-video m-video\"></video><script>if (WH.video)WH.video.add(document.getElementById('mvid-f932af4d54'));</script>\n<ul><li>If using vanilla extract, you can add it to the mix alongside the butter and milk.</li>\n<li>Overmixing your batter is going to develop strong gluten strains, which will make your pancakes very chewy.<sup id=\"_ref-2\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 2\"><a href=\"#_note-2\">[2]</a></sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>Heat the frying pan to a medium-low flame. If you have an initial \"pancake\" setting on your stove, use that. Be sure to use non-stick spray, or a pat of butter so the pancakes won't stick.<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-4-Version-3.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 4 Version 3.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2c/Make-Pancakes-Step-4-Version-3.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-4-Version-3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div>\n<ul><li>You want the inside of the pancake to start cooking before the outside gets fully brown. A medium-low heat will allow the inside to start cooking without the outside burning. Avoid a high flame at all costs.<sup id=\"_ref-3\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 3\"><a href=\"#_note-3\">[3]</a></sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>Sprinkle a few flecks of water onto your pan. If it 'dances', or jumps from the pan with a sizzle, the pan is ready for the batter.<br /><br /><video playsinline=\"\" webkit-playsinline=\"\" id=\"mvid-5bc4ebb971\" data-poster=\"/images/thumb/6/64/Make-Pancakes-Step-5-Version-3.jpg/550px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-5-Version-3.jpg\" data-src=\"/9/9b/Make Pancakes Step 5 Version 3.360p.mp4\" controlslist=\"nodownload\" data-watermark=\"1\" data-controls=\"1\" data-vidfile=\"Make Pancakes Step 5 Version 3.360p.mp4\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"wh-video m-video\"></video><script>if (WH.video)WH.video.add(document.getElementById('mvid-5bc4ebb971'));</script></li>\n<li>Pour about 3 tablespoons to 1/4 cup batter from the tip of a large spoon or from a pitcher onto the hot griddle or greased frying pan. The amount you pour will decide the final size of your pancakes. It is best to begin with less batter, and then slowly pour more batter onto the pan to increase the pancake size.<br /><br /><video playsinline=\"\" webkit-playsinline=\"\" id=\"mvid-82212f02c3\" data-poster=\"/images/thumb/8/87/Make-Pancakes-Step-6-Version-3.jpg/550px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-6-Version-3.jpg\" data-src=\"/1/1d/Make Pancakes Step 6 Version 3.360p.mp4\" controlslist=\"nodownload\" data-watermark=\"1\" data-controls=\"1\" data-vidfile=\"Make Pancakes Step 6 Version 3.360p.mp4\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"wh-video m-video\"></video><script>if (WH.video)WH.video.add(document.getElementById('mvid-82212f02c3'));</script></li>\n<li>Cook for about two minutes or until the pancake is golden. You should see bubbles form and then pop around the edges.<sup id=\"_ref-4\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 4\"><a href=\"#_note-4\">[4]</a></sup> When the bubbles at the edge of the batter pop and a hole is left that does not immediately close up, flip the cake gently.<sup id=\"_ref-5\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 5\"><a href=\"#_note-5\">[5]</a></sup><sup id=\"_ref-6\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 6\"><a href=\"#_note-6\">[6]</a></sup><div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-7-Version-3.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 7 Version 3.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Make-Pancakes-Step-7-Version-3.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-7-Version-3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Cook the other side until golden and remove. Want a deeper color? Repeat the steps for another thirty seconds per side until the pancake is done enough for your tastes.<br /><br /><video playsinline=\"\" webkit-playsinline=\"\" id=\"mvid-8bdb8a250c\" data-poster=\"/images/thumb/8/87/Make-Pancakes-Step-8-Version-3.jpg/550px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-8-Version-3.jpg\" data-src=\"/7/7c/Make Pancakes Step 8 Version 3.360p.mp4\" controlslist=\"nodownload\" data-watermark=\"1\" data-controls=\"1\" data-vidfile=\"Make Pancakes Step 8 Version 3.360p.mp4\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"wh-video m-video\"></video><script>if (WH.video)WH.video.add(document.getElementById('mvid-8bdb8a250c'));</script></li>\n<li>Enjoy! Try adding butter, <a href=\"/Make-Peanut-Butter\" title=\"Make Peanut Butter\">peanut butter</a>, syrup, jelly, chocolate chips, cookies,  candy crumbles or fruit to your pancakes for a different, more exciting flavor.<sup id=\"_ref-7\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 7\"><a href=\"#_note-7\">[7]</a></sup> The varieties are endless. These are the most delectable pancakes you will ever taste.<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-9-Version-3.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 9 Version 3.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Make-Pancakes-Step-9-Version-3.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-9-Version-3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"More-Varieties-of-Pancakes\">More Varieties of Pancakes</span></h3>\n<ol><li>Make <a href=\"/Make-Rainbow-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Rainbow Pancakes\">rainbow pancakes</a>. Looking for a colorful twist to your pancakes? Rainbow pancakes are the way to go! They are quick, easy, and fun to make. Little ones enjoy the beautiful colors added to their pancakes for a lovely 'rainbow'.<sup id=\"_ref-8\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 8\"><a href=\"#_note-8\">[8]</a></sup><div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-10.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 10.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/33/Make-Pancakes-Step-10.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-10.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Make <a href=\"/Make-Fluffy-Pancakes\" title=\"Make Fluffy Pancakes\">fluffy pancakes</a>. Having delicious fluffy pancakes that look like a pillow are one of the best pancakes out there. Finishing off with rich maple syrup will make your pancakes the bomb!<sup id=\"_ref-9\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 9\"><a href=\"#_note-9\">[9]</a></sup><div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-11.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 11.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Make-Pancakes-Step-11.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-11.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Try a variety of fruit pancakes. They are many types of fruit pancakes to try from and do make your breakfast a hint healthier. Examples can be such as <a href=\"/Make-Blueberry-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Blueberry Pancakes\">blueberry pancakes</a>, apple pancakes, and even pear pancakes. Find your favorite!<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-12.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 12.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/6d/Make-Pancakes-Step-12.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-12.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Make <a href=\"/Make-Bisquick-Mix-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Bisquick Mix Pancakes\">Bisquick mix pancakes</a>. If you're not in the mood to make your yummy breakfast from scratch, grab your Bisquick mix box and whip some tasty pancakes that taste nearly homemade.<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-13.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 13.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7a/Make-Pancakes-Step-13.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-13.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Make <a href=\"/Make-Buttermilk-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Buttermilk Pancakes\">buttermilk pancakes</a>. Sometimes using what you have on hand can make something taste so good, and in this case, buttermilk. Buttermilk pancakes are faster to make so they are perfect for moving-on morning rushes. Cook these pancakes with a close eye and top them off with anything you desire.<sup id=\"_ref-10\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 10\"><a href=\"#_note-10\">[10]</a></sup> <br clear=\"all\" /><div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-14.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 14.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Make-Pancakes-Step-14.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-14.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Make basic pancakes. You don't always have to carry on a bunch of ingredients to make something so good such as pancakes. Make easy pancakes that you and everyone else will love.<div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-15.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 15.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/51/Make-Pancakes-Step-15.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-15.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li>\n<li>Make <a href=\"/Make-Mickey-Mouse-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Mickey Mouse Pancakes\">Mickey Mouse pancakes</a>. They're cute, easy, and super yummy. Kids will enjoy these pancakes if they are a big Disney fan!<sup id=\"_ref-11\" class=\"reference\" aria-label=\"Link to Reference 11\"><a href=\"#_note-11\">[11]</a></sup> <div class=\"mwimg  largeimage  floatcenter \" style=\"max-width:728px\"><a href=\"/Image:Make-Pancakes-Step-16.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Make Pancakes Step 16.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/38/Make-Pancakes-Step-16.jpg/aid33060-v4-728px-Make-Pancakes-Step-16.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"410\" class=\"whcdn\" /></a></div></li></ol>\n<h3><span id=\"What-Are-Tips-For-Making-Pancakes-From-Scratch?\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"What-Are-Tips-For-Making-Pancakes-From-Scratch.3F\"><span class=\"questionmethod\"></span>What Are Tips For Making Pancakes From Scratch?</span></h3>\n<center>\n<div id=\"Expert-Video\" class=\"embedvideocontainer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-image: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QJQuOfPvu3c/hqdefault.jpg); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center;\"><iframe class=\"embedvideo lazy content-fill\" id=\"youtube_embed_iframe_QJQuOfPvu3c\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QJQuOfPvu3c?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem(\"youtube_embed_iframe_QJQuOfPvu3c\")</script></div>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Shopping-List-and-Recipe\">Shopping List and Recipe</span></h3>\n<div id=\"sd_container\" class=\"sd_lightbox sd_obscured\"><div class=\"sd_thumb sd_normal\"><div class=\"sd_content\"><a href=\"/Sample/Pancakes-Shopping-List\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"sd_link\" data-sample-title=\"Sample Pancakes Shopping List\" data-sample-link=\"/Sample/Pancakes-Shopping-List\"><img class=\"whcdn\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\" data-src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png/340px-Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png\" id=\"6a7a1fecccd8a\" /><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem('6a7a1fecccd8a')</script><noscript><img class=\"whcdn\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png/340px-Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\"/></noscript><span>Sample Pancakes Shopping List</span></a></div></div><div class=\"sd_thumb sd_amp\" id=\"wh-dialog-sample_fde78836b5499acee3887120285a08ae\"><div class=\"sd_content\"><a href=\"/Sample/Pancakes-Shopping-List\" class=\"sd_link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"whcdn\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\" data-src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png/340px-Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png\" id=\"6a7a1fecccd8a\" /><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem('6a7a1fecccd8a')</script><noscript><img class=\"whcdn\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png/340px-Pancakes-Shopping-List_sample.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\"/></noscript><span>Sample Pancakes Shopping List</span></a></div></div><div class=\"sd_thumb sd_normal\"><div class=\"sd_content\"><a href=\"/Sample/Pancake-Recipe\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"sd_link\" data-sample-title=\"Sample Pancake Recipe\" data-sample-link=\"/Sample/Pancake-Recipe\"><img class=\"whcdn\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\" data-src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Pancake-Recipe_sample.png/340px-Pancake-Recipe_sample.png\" id=\"6a7a1feccd13c\" /><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem('6a7a1feccd13c')</script><noscript><img class=\"whcdn\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Pancake-Recipe_sample.png/340px-Pancake-Recipe_sample.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\"/></noscript><span>Sample Pancake Recipe</span></a></div></div><div class=\"sd_thumb sd_amp\" id=\"wh-dialog-sample_fa6b55feaae8850a9e8a8e9ddaee65a2\"><div class=\"sd_content\"><a href=\"/Sample/Pancake-Recipe\" class=\"sd_link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"whcdn\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\" data-src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Pancake-Recipe_sample.png/340px-Pancake-Recipe_sample.png\" id=\"6a7a1feccd13c\" /><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem('6a7a1feccd13c')</script><noscript><img class=\"whcdn\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Pancake-Recipe_sample.png/340px-Pancake-Recipe_sample.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"440\"/></noscript><span>Sample Pancake Recipe</span></a></div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span></h2>\n<center>\n<div id=\"Expert-Video\" class=\"embedvideocontainer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-image: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xqGdMFabjus/hqdefault.jpg); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center;\"><iframe class=\"embedvideo lazy content-fill\" id=\"youtube_embed_iframe_xqGdMFabjus\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xqGdMFabjus?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem(\"youtube_embed_iframe_xqGdMFabjus\")</script></div>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<table width=\"375px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><br />\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reader-Videos\">Reader Videos</span></h2>\n<center>\n<div id=\"Expert-Video\" class=\"embedvideocontainer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-image: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P5mMWBCe7YM/hqdefault.jpg); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center;\"><iframe class=\"embedvideo lazy content-fill\" id=\"youtube_embed_iframe_P5mMWBCe7YM\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P5mMWBCe7YM?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem(\"youtube_embed_iframe_P5mMWBCe7YM\")</script></div>\n</center>\n<center>\n<div id=\"Expert-Video\" class=\"embedvideocontainer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-image: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BQ7N586D0AI/hqdefault.jpg); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center;\"><iframe class=\"embedvideo lazy content-fill\" id=\"youtube_embed_iframe_BQ7N586D0AI\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BQ7N586D0AI?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><script>WH.shared.addScrollLoadItem(\"youtube_embed_iframe_BQ7N586D0AI\")</script></div>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is helpful if you stay near the stove when the pancake is cooking so it doesn't burn up.</li>\n<li>Make thin mini pancakes and create sandwiches with cheese, jam, chocolate, fruits, or candy in between for yummy snack bites.</li>\n<li>Try putting cinnamon sugar on the pancake while it is in the pan. After it is finished cooking, roll it up, and serve it as a \"mock crepe\" for a delicious treat.</li>\n<li>Try adding ingredients to your batter instead of topping your pancakes with them. A few ideas include chocolate chips (milk or dark), bits of fruit (strawberries, bananas, blueberries or cherries, etc.), crisp bacon bits, a little grated cheese, your favorite nuts, or different spices such as cinnamon.</li>\n<li>If you want to make red velvet pancakes, you can add cocoa powder and red food coloring to the pancake batter.</li>\n<li>If you want it to be really sweet, add syrup, chocolate-hazelnut spread, sugar, chocolate sprinkles, or honey to the finished pancakes. You could also try making a simple raspberry coulis or strawberry syrup for something different to top your pancakes.</li>\n<li>Use a clean, recycled ketchup bottle to mix and pour pancake batter without making a mess.</li>\n<li>On Fat Tuesday (Shrove Tuesday), pancakes are eaten because they primarily feature sugar, fat, and flour, which are all restricted during the fasting of Lent.</li>\n<li>As there are many cultures in which pancakes are made, there are many different recipes. Some things to experiment with include:\n<ul><li>Using beer or sparkling water along with the milk will give it a slightly different taste. In the case of beer, the addition will also make it rise better if you're not using baking powder.</li>\n<li>The ratio between the fluids (milk, sparkling water, beer) and the solids (flour) determines whether the pancake will be thin (more like a French crepe) or thick (more like an American style pancake) so experiment until you find the recipe that you like most.</li>\n<li>If you don't want the pancakes to stick to the pan, you can also put in sunflower oil. This oil has a higher burning temperature (smoke point) than butter so it is better suited for use in hot pans.</li>\n<li>For a very fluffy pancake, use vanilla-flavored or fruit-flavored yogurt mixed with water for your liquid portion.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Try low carb pancakes. You can use high protein powders and egg or egg whites to significantly lower the number of carbs.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Warnings\">Warnings</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Do not press down on pancakes while cooking. Doing so prevents them from getting fluffy.</li>\n<li>Do not stack pancakes on top of each other as that will cause them to drape from the steam and make them soggy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Things-You&#39;ll-Need\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Things-You.27ll-Need\">Things You'll Need</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bowls for mixing</li>\n<li>Tool shaker or a whisker</li>\n<li>Flat pan or teflon</li>\n<li>Spatula</li>\n<li>Tablespoons</li>\n<li>Measuring cup or glass</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related-wikiHows\">Related wikiHows</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Make-Low-Carb-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Low Carb Pancakes\">Make Low Carb Pancakes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Make-Blackberry-Pancakes\" class=\"interwiki_otherdomain\" title=\"Make Blackberry Pancakes\">Make Blackberry Pancakes</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Expert-Interview\">Expert Interview</span></h2>\n<p>Thanks for reading our article! If you\u2019d like to learn more about making pancakes, check out our in-depth <span id=\"wh-dialog-sample_bb2c33dd377abb17f4c0e5a784a37f82\"><a class=\"expert_interview_link sd_link\" data-sample-title=\"wikiHow Expert Interview Transcript Expert Taylor DeCosta\" data-sample-link=\"/Sample/wikiHow-Expert-Interview-Transcript-Expert-Taylor-DeCosta\" href=\"#wh-dialog-sample_bb2c33dd377abb17f4c0e5a784a37f82\" rel=\"nofollow\">interview</a></span> with [v162347_b01].\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"_note-1\"><a href=\"#_ref-1\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.food.com/recipe/petes-scratch-pancakes-5170\">https://www.food.com/recipe/petes-scratch-pancakes-5170</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-2\"><a href=\"#_ref-2\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\">[v162347_b01]. 19 April 2023.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-3\"><a href=\"#_ref-3\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\">[v162347_b01]. 19 April 2023.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-4\"><a href=\"#_ref-4\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\">[v162347_b01]. 19 April 2023.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-5\"><a href=\"#_ref-5\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.foodnetwork.com/how-to/articles/how-to-make-perfect-pancakes\">https://www.foodnetwork.com/how-to/articles/how-to-make-perfect-pancakes</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-6\"><a href=\"#_ref-6\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.taste.com.au/recipes/easy-pancake-recipe/232125a6-05fc-4f78-b5c5-f8e5298a99ed\">https://www.taste.com.au/recipes/easy-pancake-recipe/232125a6-05fc-4f78-b5c5-f8e5298a99ed</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-7\"><a href=\"#_ref-7\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.taste.com.au/recipes/easy-pancake-recipe/232125a6-05fc-4f78-b5c5-f8e5298a99ed\">https://www.taste.com.au/recipes/easy-pancake-recipe/232125a6-05fc-4f78-b5c5-f8e5298a99ed</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-8\"><a href=\"#_ref-8\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.food.com/recipe/rainbow-pancakes-526527\">https://www.food.com/recipe/rainbow-pancakes-526527</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-9\"><a href=\"#_ref-9\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/fluffy-pancakes\">https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/fluffy-pancakes</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-10\"><a href=\"#_ref-10\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/buttermilk-pancakes-maple-apples-pecans\">https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/buttermilk-pancakes-maple-apples-pecans</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"_note-11\"><a href=\"#_ref-11\">\u2191</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://recipes.net/breakfast/pancakes/apple-cinnamon-mickey-mouse-pancakes-recipe/\">https://recipes.net/breakfast/pancakes/apple-cinnamon-mickey-mouse-pancakes-recipe/</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quick-Summary\">Quick Summary</span></h2>\n<p><video playsinline=\"\" webkit-playsinline=\"\" id=\"mvid-1217f2056f\" data-poster=\"/images/thumb/7/71/Make-Pancakes-Step-0-preview-Version-2.jpg/1000px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-0-preview-Version-2.jpg\" data-src=\"/0/04/Make Pancakes Step 0 Version 2.360p.mp4\" controlslist=\"nodownload\" data-controls=\"1\" data-vidfile=\"Make Pancakes Step 0 Version 2.360p.mp4\" title=\"How to Make Pancakes\" aria-label=\"\" data-summary=\"1\" preload=\"none\" oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" data-poster-mobile=\"/images/thumb/7/71/Make-Pancakes-Step-0-preview-Version-2.jpg/460px-nowatermark-Make-Pancakes-Step-0-preview-Version-2.jpg\" class=\"wh-video m-video m-video-summary\"></video><script>if (WH.video)WH.video.add(document.getElementById('mvid-1217f2056f'));</script>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text_summary_wrapper\">\"To begin making pancakes, beat 3 eggs in a large bowl until they\u2019re creamy. \nThen, add 2 cups (280 grams) of flour, 1/2 teaspoon of baking soda, 5 tablespoons of \nsugar, and a pinch of salt to the egg mixture. Then, pour 2 tablespoons of melted butter \nand 1 1/2 cups (375 milliliters) of milk into the bowl and stir all the ingredients together. \nNext, pour a spoonful of the batter into a pan on medium-low heat, cook each side for 2 minutes and serve.\" <span id=\"summary_last_sentence\"></span><span id=\"summary_position\" class=\"sumpos_bottom\"></span></p>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260810190100\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 445/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 1452/1000000\nPost\u2010expand include size: 2234/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 604/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 10689/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.437      1 -total\n 34.27%   11.458      5 Template:Whvid\n 11.86%    3.965      1 Template:Fa\n 11.39%    3.807      1 Template:Reflist\n  9.41%    3.147      1 Video:Make-Pancakes\n  5.12%    1.713      1 Summary:Make-Pancakes\n  2.63%    0.878      1 Template:Curatevideo\n  2.27%    0.759      2 Template:ReaderVid\n  2.26%    0.755      1 Template:ExpertVid\n  2.22%    0.742      1 Template:Questionmethod\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikidb_112:pcache:idhash:33060-0!canonical!responsiveimages=0 and timestamp 20260810190100 and revision id 33606715\n -->\n</div>"},"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Ingredients","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":221,"anchor":"Ingredients"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Steps","number":"2","index":"2","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":722,"anchor":"Steps"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Recipe for Pancakes","number":"2.1","index":"3","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":734,"anchor":"Recipe-for-Pancakes"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"More Varieties of Pancakes","number":"2.2","index":"4","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":4319,"anchor":"More-Varieties-of-Pancakes"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"What Are Tips For Making Pancakes From Scratch?","number":"2.3","index":"5","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":6584,"anchor":"What-Are-Tips-For-Making-Pancakes-From-Scratch.3F"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Shopping List and Recipe","number":"2.4","index":"6","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":6683,"anchor":"Shopping-List-and-Recipe"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Video","number":"3","index":"7","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":6898,"anchor":"Video"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Reader Videos","number":"4","index":"8","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":6936,"anchor":"Reader-Videos"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Tips","number":"5","index":"9","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":7007,"anchor":"Tips"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Warnings","number":"6","index":"10","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":9360,"anchor":"Warnings"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Things You'll Need","number":"7","index":"11","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":9579,"anchor":"Things-You.27ll-Need"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Related wikiHows","number":"8","index":"12","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","byteoffset":9720,"anchor":"Related-wikiHows"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Expert Interview","number":"9","index":"13","fromtitle":"Make-Pancakes","by